{"2954090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nion Forge", "steam_appid": 2954090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play the Demo now for free.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nion Forge is an <strong>action roguelite</strong> where you fight swarms of enemies above the streets of a cyberpunk city – in <strong>a ship you built yourself</strong>. Fast, arcade-style and hands-on: you're actually flying, not just walking in circles. A run to the fourth boss takes around 20 to 30 minutes. How much time you spend in the hangar after that is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/4b3f2fce027b665a4be073dc1d23b4c0.poster.avif?t=1787786468\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/4b3f2fce027b665a4be073dc1d23b4c0.webm?t=1787786468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/4b3f2fce027b665a4be073dc1d23b4c0.mp4?t=1787786468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your ship is your build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put it together in the hangar from 50+ modules and enter the games: 9 districts, 9 bosses, and beyond them, the way out. Run went sideways? Come back with scrap and build it better: 100+ upgrades, 30+ cores, countless builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/4d4d597399498a6c86d000818734d0f5.poster.avif?t=1787786468\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/4d4d597399498a6c86d000818734d0f5.webm?t=1787786468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/4d4d597399498a6c86d000818734d0f5.mp4?t=1787786468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your own path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades are class-based: you steer where your run is heading instead of hoping for the right upgrades. More modules means more options in the pool – not more junk in your picks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/e34f31ac6c4c11cfa93c3ea66316d78b.poster.avif?t=1787786468\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/e34f31ac6c4c11cfa93c3ea66316d78b.webm?t=1787786468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/e34f31ac6c4c11cfa93c3ea66316d78b.mp4?t=1787786468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies drop scrap. Scrap becomes modules in the shop. Modules become your next attempt in the hangar. And if top-down feels too relaxed for you: switch the camera and fly the chaos in third-person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/14f7b27a7f59628909e30497a0d28148.poster.avif?t=1787786468\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/14f7b27a7f59628909e30497a0d28148.webm?t=1787786468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/14f7b27a7f59628909e30497a0d28148.mp4?t=1787786468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist the main game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're a two-person team, and every wishlist helps us directly. Join our Discord if you'd like to share your thoughts on the game or get to know the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks, and have fun playing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play the Demo now for free.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nion Forge is an <strong>action roguelite</strong> where you fight swarms of enemies above the streets of a cyberpunk city – in <strong>a ship you built yourself</strong>. Fast, arcade-style and hands-on: you're actually flying, not just walking in circles. A run to the fourth boss takes around 20 to 30 minutes. How much time you spend in the hangar after that is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/4b3f2fce027b665a4be073dc1d23b4c0.poster.avif?t=1787786468\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/4b3f2fce027b665a4be073dc1d23b4c0.webm?t=1787786468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/4b3f2fce027b665a4be073dc1d23b4c0.mp4?t=1787786468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your ship is your build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put it together in the hangar from 50+ modules and enter the games: 9 districts, 9 bosses, and beyond them, the way out. Run went sideways? Come back with scrap and build it better: 100+ upgrades, 30+ cores, countless builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/4d4d597399498a6c86d000818734d0f5.poster.avif?t=1787786468\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/4d4d597399498a6c86d000818734d0f5.webm?t=1787786468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/4d4d597399498a6c86d000818734d0f5.mp4?t=1787786468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your own path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades are class-based: you steer where your run is heading instead of hoping for the right upgrades. More modules means more options in the pool – not more junk in your picks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/e34f31ac6c4c11cfa93c3ea66316d78b.poster.avif?t=1787786468\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/e34f31ac6c4c11cfa93c3ea66316d78b.webm?t=1787786468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/e34f31ac6c4c11cfa93c3ea66316d78b.mp4?t=1787786468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies drop scrap. Scrap becomes modules in the shop. Modules become your next attempt in the hangar. And if top-down feels too relaxed for you: switch the camera and fly the chaos in third-person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/14f7b27a7f59628909e30497a0d28148.poster.avif?t=1787786468\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/14f7b27a7f59628909e30497a0d28148.webm?t=1787786468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/14f7b27a7f59628909e30497a0d28148.mp4?t=1787786468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist the main game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're a two-person team, and every wishlist helps us directly. Join our Discord if you'd like to share your thoughts on the game or get to know the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks, and have fun playing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Your ship is your build. Put it together in the hangar from 50+ modules and enter the games: 9 districts, 9 bosses, one time limit - and beyond them, freedom. Run went sideways? Come back with scrap and build it better. 100+ upgrades, 30+ cores, countless builds.", "supported_languages": "English, German, French, Simplified Chinese, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/7251c2514032a75a4e345da4e047d4b42df78f5d/header.jpg?t=1787786468", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/49e63694f47b9a7309dd99ef1041d49311927b34/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787786468", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/49e63694f47b9a7309dd99ef1041d49311927b34/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787786468", "website": "https://nionforge.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><stron